aa.research.arcane_arteries.text=Infuse stone in a Crucible or a Mana Pool to obtain Thaumic and Mana Slates, which a Blood Altar can turn into Reinforced Slates. Each slate crafts a rune usable as a Blood Rune in altar construction. The Runic Altar and Crucible yield more efficient sacrificial daggers, while the Mana Pool and Infusion yield more efficient daggers of sacrifice.
